OL,3,GNEWSATribute to motorcyclist killed in
OL,4,AM27 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a motorcyclist who died
OL,7,Fin a crash on the M27 has paid tribute
OL,8,Fto the "devoted husband, loving father
OL,9,Fof five and proud grandfather of 10".
OL,11,FPolice were called to the crash,
OL,12,Finvolving a black and white Triumph
OL,13,Fmotorcycle, on the eastbound
OL,14,Fcarriageway between junctions 11 and 12
OL,15,Fon 16 October.
OL,17,FRichard Skilton, 66, from Gosport,
OL,18,FHampshire, was pronounced dead at the
OL,19,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,336,330,200,160,0,100
