OL,3,GNEWSATribute to motorcyclist killed in
OL,4,AM27 crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, his family said he was
OL,7,Fa "passionate motorcycle enthusiast",
OL,8,Fwho had dedicated "many years of his
OL,9,Flife to serving his country" in the
OL,10,FRoyal Navy.
